      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOY CRUSH (1) recorded a strong on-pace win here last time over 1000m. Great return after being tested in some nice races last prep and the advantage of a run this time in might give him the edge over SWIFT RULER (2). He's done little wrong, though, and can be expected to return in fine form. GREY OL' DAY (5) could be the big improver. Was well-beaten on debut, but was interesting to see there was market support at a price that day and she has won a trial ahead of the return. YAMANEX (7) is a maiden galloper resuming from a spell but will find this much easier than the G2 Karrakatta Plate at the latest appearance on April 18.",
